swift-gigatoken is an independent Pure Swift implementation inspired by and
informed by that original work. The gigatoken name and the high-throughput
tokenization direction originate with Marcel Roed's project. This repository
does not claim authorship of the original project or its Rust implementation.

The r50k_base compatibility fixture originates from OpenAI's public tiktoken
model data. Its source URL and SHA-256 digest are documented in the test suite
and README.
